#: badend3:badend3_C70F299F_DA84_4B00_9E9E_EDA04274BA9A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 616727d7c9f1b20b49f73756ece697a686516d5e4f67073cd540a406754e5ba4
#. default-sha256: e1aa3025526cd89a444276206e246faa7a8609e4a23d99c271b9b3ff4b9ceae4
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_C70F299F_DA84_4B00_9E9E_EDA04274BA9A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫I "
"can’t force her to do something she doesn’t want to."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫……彼女に強要"
"することが、⟪k:16⟫出来ない……。"

#: badend3:badend3_74F825C4_270A_4F90_9221_8B5CA412E57C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f8d1206d9d4f4584574441d688b453d6b4cb633d3a6d1056d5be9b5b92ae4f7
#. default-sha256: 8b89ccf6c20ab523ad8a8df420d68eed31a7198256a6390a45dfed17d744df4a
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_74F825C4_270A_4F90_9221_8B5CA412E57C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If she doesn’t reclaim herself on her own... ⟪k:1⟫I’ll never get to hear her say my name "
"again..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女が自分自身を取り戻さなければ……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫彼女は永遠に、⟪k:3⟫私の名を呼びはしないだろう……。"

#: badend3:badend3_547360EE_32D4_4534_8ED5_5D740F96586D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9af0b88e08eec316c7d70784549d996d562380b50d0ac7a4ebd9a0d963e2f7c6
#. default-sha256: 388262685b731132457b0469d1fceb05a8916ddec14234f066aaf463fed17419
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_547360EE_32D4_4534_8ED5_5D740F96586D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But if she wants to leave all that behind her... ⟪k:1⟫then it’s not my place to interfere."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれどそれすらも、⟪k:1⟫捨て去りたい過去だというのならば……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫入り込むことなど出来な"
"い……。"

#: badend3:badend3_547360EE_32D4_4534_8ED5_5D740F96686D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14767c5c1b7cef4801365d73df4ee7650c16f90559a562876da6afd730f8b47f
#. default-sha256: 17eb595f1ba91693071c35ca5934363b632db4a8895390fc109ead8d1641d0c8
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_547360EE_32D4_4534_8ED5_5D740F96686D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ve done things that would warrant her wanting to rewrite her past, erasing me entirely."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫過去を塗り替え、⟪k:1⟫私の存在を消そうとする程の行いを――彼女にしてしまったのだから。"

#: badend3:badend3_14501C98_A043_4232_9EFD_BCFC5DCC400A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5aaedafb952fa19a45901c08f8a20771dc4ffedbf6a5715093029d6f4ae60b82
#. default-sha256: 2f0090c5d0c32f0bc9a56ea3f70f1b9debe8502c30160dd24cb7feb72840102d
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_14501C98_A043_4232_9EFD_BCFC5DCC400A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I think, more than anything..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私は――、⟪k:1⟫きっと、⟪k:2⟫なによりも……"

#: badend3:badend3_71304866_D2C8_406C_A8AF_B269483EF474
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc333bd3b44eebf8942b800b6c38c93bcf1f9fe9794afb3e022367b78789797c
#. default-sha256: a8734c978b955b597c854684dfa423cb5ada89595bff3ee0a94aeba02b54decb
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_71304866_D2C8_406C_A8AF_B269483EF474"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m afraid of hurting her, of breaking her any more than she already is."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女をこれ以上傷つけ、⟪k:1⟫壊してしまうのを、⟪k:2⟫恐れている……。"

#: badend3:badend3_202FBE8C_5025_42D3_AB14_844F51FDD442
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2466c28e8d903d81e01961356580427ef756175b694f5dc470192a758cc32a39
#. default-sha256: 9dd3cbdafeb86e46212886c675c55fb308e3233b9dcac477cdfaad01540a2c99
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_202FBE8C_5025_42D3_AB14_844F51FDD442"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………。"

#: badend3:badend3_63F96811_C8E8_4907_87B9_416FA37B0D60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 754cbf945c68845111e07c667cdfb045d027d6dff6a9d23f6733f052b3a6421a
#. default-sha256: 5c45d83e28a62d26521463f909f503d8f467ed270843599af598401025fc7ea9
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_63F96811_C8E8_4907_87B9_416FA37B0D60"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, mine is a more cowardly fear.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m just afraid she’ll no longer take my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫いいや、⟪k:1⟫違う……もっと臆病な恐怖だ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫彼女が、⟪k:4⟫私の手を取ってくれなくなること"
"を……恐れている。"

#: badend3:badend3_9B32C9AE_4431_40EB_8BDD_4E5E2BDCC447
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8dbcc4d693a376904e1611fd8f9b1e6565e66b259e105c4550b1ba8ac8cf2f79
#. default-sha256: d308c22633e156c6518f383d17c05d7a9ba511fd9efb0b891e1402caea4a931b
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_9B32C9AE_4431_40EB_8BDD_4E5E2BDCC447"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right... ⟪k:2⟫then..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫分かり……⟪k:2⟫ました……。"

#: badend3:badend3_F984F247_AA15_40B3_9095_233FAF5E052E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd77e67def553db9dd1ca42ad1d8fa7597a17dd419d2ecf0dcd9d3d1e4afb7d3
#. default-sha256: a74cb53255b5becdb49eed4e55937df90210dea939b95e903308b39249f238e5
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_F984F247_AA15_40B3_9095_233FAF5E052E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What should have been behind the door... ⟪k:1⟫was our life together."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫扉の奥にあったはずのものは、⟪k:1⟫本当は……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私と彼女の生活だったはずだ。"

#: badend3:badend3_F35D6B1C_3494_447D_A012_22EF8C656B19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e0b2c41141bb560be1dbe12e70219b7910fb197d7bedacc18b3b6c8b764f695
#. default-sha256: 38b8672fb9a0f73b42b173a0c97fdab07ef59d76d34692649a8d43c8fbb45759
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_F35D6B1C_3494_447D_A012_22EF8C656B19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But for her, there’s nothing but misery there anymore.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In our time together, and in "
"me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれどそれは……、⟪k:1⟫彼女のとっては、⟪k:2⟫もう苦痛の日々でしかない。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫私の存在そのも"
"のも。"

#: badend3:badend3_B135271A_95CE_45F0_A7ED_3B803136CB56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c8072fbd409a75d68f2703ce8a1275c57f375152fc9888c2697bb2e7a764c5c
#. default-sha256: fc21f66b29170d3bc1b2a85c223e40ef9defaf7a2a59dc1fe160006962666579
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_B135271A_95CE_45F0_A7ED_3B803136CB56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Forget everything I’ve said.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The tale within the fourth door was the whole truth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……私の言葉は忘れてください。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫君が見せてくれた扉の向こうが……⟪k:3⟫すべての真実だった。"

#: badend3:badend3_A6302219_4360_40D0_9A8C_5619F188455C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e299663e0fa494965cfeea7fa020f598ed8cf2a32f2a0e77194879f945f9add
#. default-sha256: bc2df85db725d00fae5a4024571715614b441a601731dda77c14868639be7238
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_A6302219_4360_40D0_9A8C_5619F188455C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I can live with that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それでいい……。"

#: badend3:badend3_FAF57415_6FEA_4EBA_83E5_5340DBE4ADA7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 635b5e30a687463146645bb4f602941c40b9721923374a0bef9c85c7811c2984
#. default-sha256: d5518da90e18e09fa37f8bc6e3dfcb7aa80a2e5617e81851918c7330995cc7a8
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_FAF57415_6FEA_4EBA_83E5_5340DBE4ADA7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫....................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………………。"

#: badend3:badend3_F205E639_DF0B_4F13_BC4F_A7D8A77FE9A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5334d8dc379b5ceb4dc03efd800249851d3337d0107a37f78d21c4a67d1706c9
#. default-sha256: cbb929b5a75e72a5fdca2acc30f07d53c3a799a11df4b7a56b465ea5e4d37a56
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_F205E639_DF0B_4F13_BC4F_A7D8A77FE9A0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I would just ask you to allow me one thing...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫To remain by your side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ただひとつ、⟪k:3⟫願わせて欲しい……。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫私を……⟪k:6⟫君の傍に置いてくれ……。"

#: badend3:badend3_1CBBB369_2794_43B9_9D76_29CBF71151CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bd23af3f9b4fcc20f9df806b0a8716e1d17205ebeb58479cc227489d22104e1
#. default-sha256: 846d3ffb0016417023193e3177a56eb2ffbd062b5ad13537d5380b1c974e9fb4
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_1CBBB369_2794_43B9_9D76_29CBF71151CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……そんなこと……。"

#: badend3:badend3_7617E012_B4C3_4E0E_9BDF_9A7BF2BC9F7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8e9c93ed2af489de556d8afce1f005c5ce0ee59c6f5ecfaea3ebbda87cdcf27
#. default-sha256: 9709c01ab8c3aa1efd6573356c1c1f10df6b56c5f422c0e1ed22f18b9bfc763d
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_7617E012_B4C3_4E0E_9BDF_9A7BF2BC9F7F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Of course you may."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫もちろん、⟪k:2⟫そうするに決まっているじゃありませんか。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫だってわたくし、⟪k:5⟫申"
"し上げましたもの。"

#: badend3:badend3_B66E0276_AEE5_48AA_84C5_BBE775A309AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfa702456b9b8020cd88302809339ec60458c8528b9d3f216fc09247438adb6d
#. default-sha256: 45694a5161ed6c3681889968504684c7030ddd872ef3084151ed44fd3f4777c8
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_B66E0276_AEE5_48AA_84C5_BBE775A309AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was the one who asked you...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫to forget about everything and live in eternal "
"darkness with me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫この永遠の暗闇の中で、⟪k:2⟫何もかもを忘れて……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫わたくしと共に生きましょうと。"

#: badend3:badend3_889CF03A_8988_4A6B_9154_05B232166190
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4f773f2524b459f002abfc2ad73c842dcb5ec055a1f8de722fa24ab3cf3946c
#. default-sha256: f1b2d9d7236e796e027bb0def862999e759271628c05a717f681d6725151d6a9
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_889CF03A_8988_4A6B_9154_05B232166190"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe... ⟪k:2⟫what a silly question.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Did you think I would ever say no?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ふふ……⟪k:2⟫おかしな人。⟪k:3⟫わたくしが断るはずもないのに。"

#: badend3:badend3_CD69DE7F_D1E0_4D28_A5A9_DD42EFFE124E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2466c28e8d903d81e01961356580427ef756175b694f5dc470192a758cc32a39
#. default-sha256: 9dd3cbdafeb86e46212886c675c55fb308e3233b9dcac477cdfaad01540a2c99
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_CD69DE7F_D1E0_4D28_A5A9_DD42EFFE124E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………。"

#: badend3:badend3_58A47977_610A_406A_A124_07F807C0BEC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8bbbd1b899510cbac9003585e1d9b5866b386f6d41edcb4d87c6a050d0f77e3c
#. default-sha256: 825b8169aed80472c63a0912ebbf8d54d5f20bb22f1b0d1dd05c2909e0b0622a
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_58A47977_610A_406A_A124_07F807C0BEC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Right...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You did, didn’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そう……。⟪k:1⟫……そうでしたね……。"

#: badend3:badend3_BCB801E7_1364_4128_8DD0_6657F4D6B165
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a145d22d85bf9a9f3a3594ec08407b62bbfa3001cc75a67aedaf2259368f1e0
#. default-sha256: ac874bc81acd5a5e4d50b6d7ac1a5bc5f7efa3ff3874c2e0d439502e157bd26b
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_BCB801E7_1364_4128_8DD0_6657F4D6B165"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Yes, I did. ⟪k:2⟫Worry not, I will banish the memory.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I am sure you were "
"simply disoriented at having learned who you are."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ええ、⟪k:2⟫そうですわ。⟪k:3⟫大丈夫、⟪k:4⟫あなたのお言葉は記憶いたしません。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"きっとご自分を取り戻されて、⟪k:7⟫混乱されてしまわれたのでしょう。"

#: badend3:badend3_A1187E10_34D3_4C5E_8103_EA7C68FA9C4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42dabe8c3ca53cd99537f5042f9b5119465c980613ea6d38d120c94d1af1dabb
#. default-sha256: 207b6ee1d357d59558c3c912e8eb191f93ed8025a01e36441678550410b53549
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_A1187E10_34D3_4C5E_8103_EA7C68FA9C4A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There is nothing to fear.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Only happiness awaits you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫でも、⟪k:2⟫もう大丈夫。⟪k:3⟫怖いことなど、⟪k:4⟫何ひとつございません。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫そう、"
"⟪k:7⟫これからは幸せのみが待っているのです。"

#: badend3:badend3_3F28DBBC_B943_4C4C_B38C_3B9F909A66AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2466c28e8d903d81e01961356580427ef756175b694f5dc470192a758cc32a39
#. default-sha256: 9dd3cbdafeb86e46212886c675c55fb308e3233b9dcac477cdfaad01540a2c99
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_3F28DBBC_B943_4C4C_B38C_3B9F909A66AC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………。"

#: badend3:badend3_5E64EA09_117B_4525_A7F3_166A536C201C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09c0f9b73570e2959afe94cda09bf3e0a32c6d3b963bbb0e38be739dfa102db2
#. default-sha256: a120481cedaa41e96ae1f49b958685729124ca2929a9cfdbdc76385994a09d21
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_5E64EA09_117B_4525_A7F3_166A536C201C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehehe. I am getting excited now.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What should we do first?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫うふふ、⟪k:2⟫楽しくなってまいりましたね。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫まずは何から始めましょう？"

#: badend3:badend3_432A5F2E_31DA_49C2_A4E2_ABE599E5AE13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46cd7f6d105b93a1c41cb6bab855ba3d02c7484a132bc80a1b8278254b0894b6
#. default-sha256: 1f0877aab166f1a9c50117a5b2eaee294b266e96d8eb22f72789db3b31f028c5
