msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫庭で育てた訳の分からない植物を集め、⟪k:1⟫茶にしようとする彼女に――確か私はこう言ったのだ。"

#: badend3:badend3_E5A02D3B_3697_4F31_AAA3_5CE1EC4CA49A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82b9bba4c1da40878e7fa8b2daaa82eba548b1fbb5fe73fe687ce7c51d83ec87
#. default-sha256: 5bc71227541b5b422c071ab5b0b4ee6f5fe822f4e41efb532882d88594e15cf0
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_E5A02D3B_3697_4F31_AAA3_5CE1EC4CA49A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫that doing so at this house, given its reputation, only made her look like a real witch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫「ただでさえいわくつきなのに、⟪k:1⟫薬草を集めでもしたらそれこそ本物の魔女のようだ」と。"

#: badend3:badend3_AB8ECA21_4C86_464A_918E_A1299B1E25CB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13d13067ca1d9cb44bd3ca7a5a3c62e7e66c329e997673a6b3df1baeba8a909c
#. default-sha256: 0d0089cba63ec4e9d692947017c477f45068957fbf6e1b1e30dfe883aaa2cd8a
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_AB8ECA21_4C86_464A_918E_A1299B1E25CB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And how did she react to that?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I think she puffed her cheeks and frowned, and "
"then..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それで……⟪k:1⟫彼女は何と返した？　⟪k:2⟫確かむくれて、⟪k:3⟫怒りながら……"

#: badend3:badend3_F7782A45_E5CB_4042_A1A4_32AC673D4C2A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 963f5ae5c155ed7dc13416808b052f8d455ef021f91af8cbcc7cffd9afcafadc
#. default-sha256: b187ae8209960d26aafe7751218d7045a4fdc2142ca8d390685f5f5b7c4a5237
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_F7782A45_E5CB_4042_A1A4_32AC673D4C2A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...I can’t remember."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………もう、⟪k:1⟫思い出せない。"

#: badend3:badend3_76C25893_D9E0_4442_8A32_70B6F7F55630
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c34a8e5152cdb2af824023a6d192d2ffac90ed8420fd12cece49771b45a70d9d
#. default-sha256: 1e14e79847c5ae4de55a893aec8ccfcfdc82b084f69fc47de6522fe4c64909d2
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_76C25893_D9E0_4442_8A32_70B6F7F55630"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She thinks I’m the White-Haired Girl, yet she calls me “Master,”⟪k:1⟫completely oblivious to "
"how absurd that sounds."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女は、⟪k:1⟫私を“旦那さま”と呼びながら――私を白い髪の娘だと思っている。⟪k:2⟫その言葉の滑稽さ"
"に気づきもしないで。"

#: badend3:badend3_04CA0963_58FC_4FFE_AD57_D1DD77712DF6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0310abe4f616c345a9da86dcd109de5cfcca2b56a845a3d0bcbd8ea7438c8951
#. default-sha256: 11654adcda92e7a352293b11e755ec8aca98d34e93178a26be7cd8fd02b62282
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_04CA0963_58FC_4FFE_AD57_D1DD77712DF6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But she won’t say my name."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……彼女は私の名を呼びはしない。"

#: badend3:badend3_99892610_1DF8_4619_982C_10B67EF1C9FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d91ce6cd1ad907a33d9525806b4a1e249e46a65282c19169c8dbbc29f624635
#. default-sha256: 2bf78eb48111117ddde9ac580ba54e2c6f7d12d09791f2e0b6bd78867bde59ca
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_99892610_1DF8_4619_982C_10B67EF1C9FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eventually, I’ll probably forget it too.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My name, who I am, everything that’s "
"happened to us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫やがて私も、⟪k:1⟫忘れていくのだろうか。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私の名もろとも……⟪k:4⟫私たちに起きたすべての"
"出来事を。"

#: badend3:badend3_452B56E3_3F6E_4ED2_9D27_FA1CC2D8CFF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 733a1cf3f047c57da5ff7d6dcb1eac29d9f5e84a2d011fc19d48d1431e748b63
#. default-sha256: ab0d96908d6cf2c5b4ba717e29801786e6f3dc1a38e74c9061b9b0c070863c09
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_452B56E3_3F6E_4ED2_9D27_FA1CC2D8CFF2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Washed away by the darkness, never to be found again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫すべてを明らかにしないまま……⟪k:1⟫流されていくのだろうか。"

#: badend3:badend3_C5E3CE9F_9933_42BA_91DE_F19EDECF056F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e72cafd8b2c72f2c3d12651767398d28886000465b6748484201949368c2dfe
#. default-sha256: 98a939c0ccc73fe7d6c56bbb4bf582cdcfb92ba8b40c6a60c6a04da0cdd4ee64
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_C5E3CE9F_9933_42BA_91DE_F19EDECF056F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She’s smiling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……彼女が微笑んでいる。"

#: badend3:badend3_65601CDE_EAE1_49B2_9B8D_80FA78FE4368
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ae452e2b9c28b15b1903dbda7ff9b2672773fa765505fddb0a43ba3f9c28338
#. default-sha256: f77c002822b9910d197028052a6581ffb065217b5fff016ad5571f4d463c3965
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_65601CDE_EAE1_49B2_9B8D_80FA78FE4368"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I know it’s not real, but I honestly don’t care anymore."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それが偽りのものだと知っていても、⟪k:1⟫もう、⟪k:2⟫私は何も言えない……。"

#: badend3:badend3_68B941A9_D052_4BD6_8545_CA43B59D7AF3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab45d509779af6afbd3a7eb6b71f9bde0046cad6c4be9341ba97347e9e0bd9ee
#. default-sha256: 7dd36490abfae073c52e1419cefa8a097d0bd9e8c7007392bfa6c4415c4ee543
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_68B941A9_D052_4BD6_8545_CA43B59D7AF3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All that matters is that she’s smiling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女が笑っていさえすれば、⟪k:1⟫それでいい……。"
